      'DispositionBuyerTimelineController'" and the Deal Summary card's fail-soft
      "Couldn't load the deal summary." Only the three ENTRY-POINT controllers are granted here,
      matching this file's established pattern (see the PortfolioDealController and
      BrokerLeaderboardController comments below): the selector/service classes each controller
      calls (BovBrokerChangeSelector, DispositionBuyerTimelineService, DispositionDealSummaryService)
      are reached only through the controller and need no grant of their own.
      NdaBuyerStampService and DispositionOfferBuyerStampService, shipped the same day, are NOT
